  "Recovery page (IPFS)": "Página de recuperación (IPFS)",
  "Anyone can run the vault: your wallet signs the steps that are due (collect, sell, liquidity, creator reward, payouts) and pays their network fees; you earn the crank reward, 1% of the holders' XNT from each sale (up to 0.05 XNT).": "Cualquiera puede ejecutar la bóveda: tu billetera firma los pasos pendientes (cobrar, vender, liquidez, recompensa del creador, pagos) y paga sus comisiones de red; tú ganas la recompensa del crank, el 1% de los XNT de los holders de cada venta (hasta 0.05 XNT).",
  "not started yet": "aún sin iniciar",
