  "Whole tokens, {supplyMin} to {supplyMax}. {curveBps}% is sold on the curve; the rest goes into the pool.": "Tokens enteros, de {supplyMin} a {supplyMax}. El {curveBps}% se vende en la curva; el resto entra al pool.",
